[{"title":"题黄中书画竹赠王主事","author":"李时勉","text":"行营写竹万全西，翠影翛翛望欲迷。\n客至只疑临嶰谷，兴来浑忆钓璜溪。\n虚心寒历风霜劲，密叶春承雨露低。\n自是郎官堪比德，新诗吟罢为君题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月中秋日午一时飓风起南北云阴而中独见日南山外雷雨大作须臾而霁","author":"李时勉","text":"每逢佳节愁阴凝，八月十五尤喜晴。\n百里精兵临塞驻，一时飓风疑海行。\n天中白日临空净，山外黑云飞雨声。\n轰雷掣电在咫尺，倏忽还收宇宙清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨名堡","author":"李时勉","text":"杨名旧日说繁华，桃树垂杨绕县衙。\n自扫边尘清朔漠，空馀雉堞乱啼鸦。\n连村禾黍犹千亩，满堡人烟有几家。\n访古从容问耆老，出门不觉夕阳斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄鼠","author":"李时勉","text":"柘彩凝沙映日光，平原窟宅翳苍茫。\n拱门岂畏飞鹰搏，入穴还如狡兔藏。\n物类生来形独异，天廚赐出味偏长。\n好当校猎捐躯日，莫遣傍人谩得将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮马窟","author":"李时勉","text":"饮马长城窟，马多水不乾。\n无人到关塞，甘好有谁看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客辞","author":"李时勉","text":"堂中无复事，誓与报君仇。\n一剑成何用，空令易水羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摘瓜辞","author":"李时勉","text":"辛苦黄台下，秋风瓜蔓多。\n不堪回首望，落日独悲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧羝曲","author":"李时勉","text":"漠漠黄沙外，寒毡抱雪眠。\n此心谁复识，白日在青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商妇词","author":"李时勉","text":"十年不到家，到家便辞去。\n安得作大石，塞断前头路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续弦词","author":"李时勉","text":"煎胶续断弦，弦好琴音和。\n莫弹别鹤操，好鼓南薰歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜至万全城中小寺适寺僧亦自塞上归","author":"李时勉","text":"晚来寻小寺，直在古城间。\n石路斜通市，禅房远见山。\n夜中孤客到，月下一僧还。\n静礼无生法，空门不记关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"李时勉","text":"插柳樊篱远似村，正逢九日在辕门。\n摘花随意看春色，倚剑长歌对酒尊。\n醉里犹怀陶县宰，风前谁忆孟参军。\n千官扈跸承欢宴，独愧无才负圣恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日吕尚书送烧酒","author":"李时勉","text":"葡萄家酿到边头，九日分将意独优。\n可是王弘知靖节，不劳庾信问蒲州。\n开壶泛菊香犹远，倚醉题诗兴未休。\n自觉晚来寒气薄，临风不用袭轻裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中与黄中书围棋","author":"李时勉","text":"对雨临棋局，终朝兴未阑。\n溃围尝蹈险，取势每由宽。\n动静怀张说，从容忆谢安。\n须令强敌灭，赌胜任为欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄恒脩还乡祭扫五首 其一","author":"李时勉","text":"南还六月别都城，独阻临溪送客行。\n捲地朔风吹急雨，绿杨何处有啼莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄恒脩还乡祭扫五首 其二","author":"李时勉","text":"蓟门昨夜雨如倾，潞渚朝来波浪惊。\n自是虚舟能独往，商船持重不堪行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄恒脩还乡祭扫五首 其三","author":"李时勉","text":"南行谁喜说南风，独棹扁舟逆浪中。\n夜宿广陵逢北客，几人相语此心同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄恒脩还乡祭扫五首 其四","author":"李时勉","text":"帆转青原是故乡，顿令桑梓有辉光。\n因君遥忆先茔隔，怅望南天泪几行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄恒脩还乡祭扫五首 其五","author":"李时勉","text":"封章激怒九重天，乱扑金瓜玉陛前。\n归到乡闾亲故问，幸留残喘不须怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商妇怨 其一","author":"李时勉","text":"百岁似相期，安知有别离。\n去时儿在腹，今已长过眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商妇怨 其二","author":"李时勉","text":"忆昔初结发，两鬓黑如漆。\n但恐君归来，白头不相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝","author":"李时勉","text":"章台大道边，栗里旧门前。\n苦被行人折，何如伴醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白头吟","author":"李时勉","text":"交颈鸳鸯思，鸣琴誓此心。\n如何未终曲，已有别离音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃李树","author":"李时勉","text":"托根游宴地，寒树亦花开。\n独在凄凉处，春风泪满腮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"李时勉","text":"落日层楼上，当歌忽自悲。\n空令翻白雪，此曲少人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"李时勉","text":"海上望仙山，锵然响佩环。\n如何一水近，不遣离人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流水曲","author":"李时勉","text":"沧江无日夜，脉脉向东注。\n曲岸多洑流，好为操舟渡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张百户惠李","author":"李时勉","text":"惠来仙李好，礧砢出冰盘。\n瑩洁虬珠润，赪红玛瑙寒。\n自应同石髓，谁复羡龙肝。\n若遂王戎意，如今那得看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"齐百户送冰","author":"李时勉","text":"夏热已难度，况此居樊笼。\n徽纆削我体，炎暑毒我中。\n故人致清冰，高谊谁与同。\n萧爽逼凉气，顿觉如严冬。\n食之肌骨清，烦虑俱消融。\n不闻鸣琴奏，怡然对春风。\n沈思艰危际，感激意无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李指挥惠桃","author":"李时勉","text":"仙果何处来，采摘瑶池滨。\n香含雨露润，色染胭脂匀。\n结实自有时，岂必三千春。\n方朔狎恩爱，田疆罹苦辛。\n王母何不吝，齐相何不仁。\n世情甘近味，幽思谁与论。\n感意良慇勤，稍以清形神。\n琼瑶愧相报，述古聊为陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"章郎中送茶","author":"李时勉","text":"雀舌金芽玉色鲜，贡馀独得大夫怜。\n寄来春日闻雷动，采摘云林禁火前。\n手阅香逾仙掌草，鼎烹味胜惠山泉。\n玉堂曾是誇风韵，何似陶潜乐醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕喜晴","author":"李时勉","text":"尽说穷阴七月多，忽惊此夕见明河。\n欲令霄汉星辰会，不遣阳台云雨过。\n士女茶瓜争乞巧，天孙机杼暂停梭。\n可惭独守潘生拙，圜圄诗成只自歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4007,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"李时勉","text":"万里云开天欲曙，紫陌鸣珂早朝去。\n觉来窗外雷电惊，捲地朔风雨如注。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4008,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与梁指挥饮烧酒","author":"李时勉","text":"宛胜葡萄酿，何须鹦鹉杯。\n入门便相唤，到手不教催。\n深意怜吾渴，愁怀为尔开。\n醉时即高卧，不省有人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4009,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下行吟","author":"李时勉","text":"夜卧不成梦，凄凉谁见亲。\n起行明月下，凉影伴愁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4010,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中夜饮酒","author":"李时勉","text":"中夜渴欲饮，起来还自斟。\n数杯应不醉，灯下独愁吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4011,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"李时勉","text":"斗转银河仄，虚窗瞰远天。\n夜深明月里，梦绕五云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4012,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日雨中","author":"李时勉","text":"黑云半空来，飞雨门前度。\n但闻啼鸟声，不辨云中树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4013,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四日晚至陵下","author":"李时勉","text":"昔从多士侍朝廷，尝对龙颜展寸诚。\n今日共来供祭祀，独瞻松柏不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4014,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天寿山路傍林禽树","author":"李时勉","text":"路傍林禽树，朱实亚枝垂。\n行人不敢动，山鸟时来窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4015,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路傍枣树","author":"李时勉","text":"人家枣园本无路，未热人来偷摘去。\n此中枣树在路傍，从人往来莫敢取。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4016,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过晋贤行路皆称张尹有善政","author":"李时勉","text":"试问肩舆者，应知令尹名。\n饥羸俱乐业，凶暴少横行。\n犴狱无囚系，山村有颂声。\n谁言汉卓鲁，前史独为荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4017,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五两","author":"李时勉","text":"日日船南去，飙轮忽向东。\n舟人喜相报，正是渡江风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4018,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒孝陵","author":"李时勉","text":"桥陵一别恨归迟，松柏青青似旧时。\n汉室规模长在想，鼎湖云气不胜思。\n仪文尽洗前朝弊，礼乐终为后代规。\n对越威灵在天表，壮年不遇老来悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4019,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其一","author":"李时勉","text":"太极才分有此山，龙飞凤舞拥天关。\n灵宫负扆端居处，正在云霄杳渺间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4020,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其二","author":"李时勉","text":"萧森松柏结愁阴，白日常悬旧赤心。\n翘首不瞻龙凤质，空流清泪满衣襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4021,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其三","author":"李时勉","text":"昔年端冕在枫宸，治化流行疾若神。\n万国车书归一统，四方风俗尽还淳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4022,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其四","author":"李时勉","text":"读书直以古人期，记得当年拜命时。\n天地恩深无所报，一登廷阁一回悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4023,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其五","author":"李时勉","text":"昔日天门侍圣明，春回枯朽荷生成。\n鼎湖龙去青天远，独抱乌号泪雨倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4024,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其六","author":"李时勉","text":"曾从銮辂出边陲，掳得名王奏凯归。\n从此沙场无战斗，至今远塞震皇威。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4025,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其七","author":"李时勉","text":"少年凤阙侍龙颜，天语从容咫尺间。\n今日玉音何处听，不胜悲苦望椿山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞陵绝句 其八","author":"李时勉","text":"每遇春秋上谒时，倾心只恐到来迟。\n如今归老辞陵去，回首云山不尽思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八日发张家湾","author":"李时勉","text":"杨柳初青黄鸟鸣，长河两岸绿波平。\n乍从客路看帆影，还想君门听漏声。\n七十挂冠虽称意，五云回首尚关情。\n深恩未报身先老，俛仰乾坤愧此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连日行舟大东风","author":"李时勉","text":"长风吹河水倒流，对此如何销客愁。\n半日才行三十里，几弯还见一孤舟。\n商船屡过询名姓，驿吏频来问去留。\n计日算程关路远，菊花时节到林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿螺山庵","author":"李时勉","text":"庵屋幽僻静无哗，十里青山一径斜。\n旧引泉流长绕涧，新移茶树正开花。\n荒田草合多寒雀，旷野林稀少暮鸦。\n日夕相看谁是伴，清风明月与烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4030,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去伐遣人送五月菊石菖蒲诗以道意 其一","author":"李时勉","text":"金钱带露粲云光，九夏开时分外香。\n若使当年陶令见，赏心不但在重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4031,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去伐遣人送五月菊石菖蒲诗以道意 其二","author":"李时勉","text":"仙家瑶草种初成，此日分来独有情。\n愿遣山居尘俗远，何须嵩岭说长生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4032,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余自城中逢与粟同归过去伐隐居留宿明日告别去伐又欲留有不满之意作诗赠余勉强和之云","author":"李时勉","text":"城中逢旧友，返路喜追陪。\n欲到壶丘去，先过剡曲来。\n春舒江上柳，风度竹间梅。\n留住堪能久，无端归思催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4033,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居病中即事","author":"李时勉","text":"山居少田种，江上旋开荒。\n有病多收药，无医只检方。\n雨馀千嶂净，春暖百花香。\n游览无筋力，沉吟自可伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4034,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一春淫雨閒居寂寥有怀故人率尔短述","author":"李时勉","text":"解组归来初学耕，野田数亩不聊生。\n家贫作事难称意，年老逢人只顺情。\n久雨郊园多草色，残春堤柳少莺声。\n何应得有巡抚使，为我回辔到山城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4035,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨","author":"李时勉","text":"一月雨淋漓，山云拂户低。\n路岐泥没马，畎亩水平溪。\n江上看涛涌，林间断鸟啼。\n新居无覆瓦，终夜竟何栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4036,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中偶成","author":"李时勉","text":"去年病发到今春，春夏炎蒸病又新。\n窗下检方无验者，眼前知己有何人。\n通宵药鼎常存火，五月绵衣未去身。\n不是平生甘寂寞，可堪衰疾更长贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4037,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中去伐见访","author":"李时勉","text":"閒居闻我病，独骑远来看。\n见面深相慰，中心便觉宽。\n坐留菜羹饭，好似绮筵欢。\n临别无为赠，涛笺写肺肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4038,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题莲 其一","author":"李时勉","text":"芰荷开处蔼芳馨，鸂鶒双双应晓晴。\n绝胜金滩溪水上，时来还见绣衣行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4039,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题莲 其二","author":"李时勉","text":"鸳鸯飞下水东西，十里芙蕖望欲迷。\n只少红妆隔花语，此间不是若耶溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4040,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题莲 其三","author":"李时勉","text":"飞来白鹭傍红莲，宛在华峰玉井边。\n亦有花开逾十丈，可应得见藕如船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4041,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题莲 其四","author":"李时勉","text":"赪霞翠雾护莲房，风度晴漪漾日光。\n好是昆明池上见，粉红坠露散清香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4042,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新梢捧日","author":"李时勉","text":"密叶新梢长结阴，亭亭直节出平林。\n谁言解箨初成竹，便有云霄捧日心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4043,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淇园暑雨","author":"李时勉","text":"碧树琅玕翠作团，不胜酷暑叶声乾。\n须臾霖雨从天降，信有人间六月寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4044,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渭水秋风","author":"李时勉","text":"古木脩篁绿荫稠，一川浩浩自东流。\n锵金戛玉清如许，不为狂风也似秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4045,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老干淩云","author":"李时勉","text":"老树疏篁自作林，苍藤翠叶岁年深。\n莫言萧索寒冬里，历遍风霜却到今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4046,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘思清分教惠州","author":"李时勉","text":"衰老常多病，那堪送客行。\n且将京国酒，聊慰故乡情。\n泸水秋容净，梅关雪色清。\n惠阳施教日，帐下尽群英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4047,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏日燕饯谢谦牧大尹分韵得挥字","author":"李时勉","text":"盛时多令节，佳会未能违。\n鸣佩趋清禁，联班近紫微。\n大官应早到，方朔岂迟归。\n华馆开朝宴，清尊对夕晖。\n运交金伏火，暑赫汗沾衣。\n玄鸟先秋去，苍蝇傍席飞。\n羽觞从数劝，䊵扇不停挥。\n明日南行客，欢筵似此稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4048,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谢谦牧知黔江","author":"李时勉","text":"京华燕集几论文，作宰南行忽离群。\n鸣佩自应辞圣主，过家喜得拜严君。\n金台凫影三秋别，巫峡猿声两岸闻。\n自古循良多善政，须令黎庶乐耕耘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":4049,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]